  diseaseId: pharyngitis
  diseaseName: "FARENJ\u0130T"
  generalInfo: "Farenjit, farinks b\xF6lgesinin iltihaplanmas\u0131yla geli\u015Fen
    bir \xFCst solunum yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda bo\u011Faz
    a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, yutma g\xFC\xE7l\xFC\u011F\xFC ve hafif ate\u015F g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Bo\u011Faz a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131, Odinofaji mevcut olmas\u0131,
    kat\u0131 g\u0131da yutarken a\u011Fr\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131 ve hafif ses k\u0131s\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    mevcut olmas\u0131 farenjitte s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Hafif
    burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 ve ara ara hafif \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk var olabilir."
